{"id":"wb-6-802","name":"永昌钟鼓楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"永昌钟鼓楼","text":"永昌钟鼓楼，位于中华人民共和国甘肃省金昌市永昌县的县城中心，建成于明代万历十五年（1587年），在清朝曾有多次修缮，古浪大地震中被严重震损，后于中华人民共和国成立之后受过多次修缮。该楼通体高24.5米，可分为台基和楼体两个部分。2006年，永昌钟鼓楼被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E6%98%8C%E9%92%9F%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":93118672,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93118672","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d3f2f4d9f529a9f3d39722bd.jpg","title":"永昌钟鼓楼.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B0%B8%E6%98%8C%E9%92%9F%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/%E6%B0%B8%E6%98%8C%E9%92%9F%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"莫理循","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​1910年拍摄的永昌钟鼓楼照片。","width":320,"height":515}}